  "doc-cf58af1984b50a1dcb11591e-chunk-000": {
    "tokens": 127,
    "content": "主题ID：GUIDANCE-TOPIC-AFFECT-IDENTIFICATION\n问题框架：青少年难以命名情绪，缺乏描述情绪状态的词汇，限制了互动和调节能力。\n\n适用线索：无法命名情绪；\n\n不了解情绪含义；\n\n情绪调节困难\n目标：帮助青少年识别、命名并赋予情绪背景，增强情绪调节能力。\n\n技术：情绪标签化：识别、命名并赋予情绪背景。\n\n步骤：识别、命名并赋予情绪背景。",
    "chunk_order_index": 0,
    "split_type": "hard_fallback",
    "split_part": 1,
    "split_total": 2,
    "full_doc_id": "doc-cf58af1984b50a1dcb11591e",
    "file_path": "GUIDANCE-TOPIC-AFFECT-IDENTIFICATION.md",
    "llm_cache_list": [
      "default:extract:edbac330dc49ec5c767f9d419e21ab77",
      "default:extract:0504786dd6ad90a48afe5dd5ee808f44"
    ],
    "create_time": 1784707219,
    "update_time": 1784707294,
