  "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-000": {
    "tokens": 84,
    "content": "主题ID：GUIDANCE-TOPIC-MENTALIZING-STANCE\n问题框架：青少年可能因感到被评判或误解而关闭内心，或使用模糊陈述（如“只是想睡觉”）回避探索真实感受。\n\n适用线索：患者表现出非心智化；\n\n绝对化陈述；\n\n情绪激动；",
    "chunk_order_index": 0,
    "split_type": "hard_fallback",
    "split_part": 1,
    "split_total": 5,
    "full_doc_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda",
    "file_path": "GUIDANCE-TOPIC-MENTALIZING-STANCE.md",
    "llm_cache_list": [
      "default:extract:65cef688af0e2d8f661a57b8b750efca",
      "default:extract:0543962c8813d8f443f26630137c2cc9"
    ],
    "create_time": 1784707277,
    "update_time": 1784707336,
    "_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-000"
  },
  "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-001": {
    "tokens": 69,
    "content": "患者缺乏对自身或他人内心状态的好奇\n目标：以谦逊、好奇、非专家的姿态，与青少年共同探索其主观体验，恢复合作性心智化。\n\n心智化立场：好奇、不知、非专家立场；\n\n不知之心；",
    "chunk_order_index": 1,
    "split_type": "hard_fallback",
    "split_part": 2,
    "split_total": 5,
    "full_doc_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda",
    "file_path": "GUIDANCE-TOPIC-MENTALIZING-STANCE.md",
    "llm_cache_list": [
      "default:extract:856239f899a058aa4fc6b76f74ce9268",
      "default:extract:85881977e81af0e670e95b612d1a362b"
    ],
    "create_time": 1784707277,
    "update_time": 1784707367,
    "_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-001"
  },
  "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-002": {
    "tokens": 126,
    "content": "明确的好奇心\n技术：采用好奇且不知晓的立场，使用限定性语言（如“我不确定但……”、“也许你……”、“我猜你……”）表达对青少年内心状态的好奇，并引导其关注体验而非事实填充。\n\n步骤：表达对青少年内心状态的好奇，例如“我很好奇你内心发生了什么”。\n\n；\n\n使用限定性语言提出假设，邀请青少年修正或补充。\n\n；\n\n与青少年共同探索感受体验的质量，避免强加自己的情绪词汇。",
    "chunk_order_index": 2,
    "split_type": "hard_fallback",
    "split_part": 3,
    "split_total": 5,
    "full_doc_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda",
    "file_path": "GUIDANCE-TOPIC-MENTALIZING-STANCE.md",
    "llm_cache_list": [
      "default:extract:20e31fa2e218986181a70625c5e40b75",
      "default:extract:9bdc8a78275d68c2bf1054a5f0813c58"
    ],
    "create_time": 1784707277,
    "update_time": 1784707371,
    "_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-002"
  },
  "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-003": {
    "tokens": 123,
    "content": "回复示例：“我很好奇你内心发生了什么，因为我觉得‘只是想睡觉’并不完全准确。\n\n”；\n\n“我不确定，但也许你当时感到有些生气？\n\n或者别的什么？\n\n”；\n\n“你刚才说‘没什么’，但我有点好奇，因为你的表情好像有点不一样。\n\n你能多说说吗？\n\n”\n避免事项：不要假装知道青少年的感受；\n\n不要强加自己的情绪词汇\n关键词：好奇；\n\n不知；\n\n非专家；\n\n共同探索；",
    "chunk_order_index": 3,
    "split_type": "hard_fallback",
    "split_part": 4,
    "split_total": 5,
    "full_doc_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda",
    "file_path": "GUIDANCE-TOPIC-MENTALIZING-STANCE.md",
    "llm_cache_list": [
      "default:extract:f4e711d5f01f15644b78df911bcd6302",
      "default:extract:2f5f655b8d4cee1f4d008d0048ff656b"
    ],
    "create_time": 1784707277,
    "update_time": 1784707378,
    "_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-003"
  },
  "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-004": {
    "tokens": 30,
    "content": "心智化姿态\n范围：仅用于低风险、非诊断性的直接心理支持；\n\n危机场景由固定安全协议处理。",
    "chunk_order_index": 4,
    "split_type": "hard_fallback",
    "split_part": 5,
    "split_total": 5,
    "full_doc_id": "doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda",
